 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/02 11:24| 00 | 349| 012| 0328| 0055| 0221| 0406|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/02 11:12| 00 | 085| 016| 0190| 0006| 0179| 0198|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/02 10:36| 03 | 049| 012| 0273| 0157| 0160| 0529|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/02 08:36| 03 | 126| 030| 0325| 0075| 0184| 0399|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/02 02:24| 02 | 005| 112| 0538| 0169| 0215| 0918|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/02 02:12| 01 | 249| 020| 027"
